1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,222
Speaking, task two. Card number 13. You are at a fitness centre and want to start working out. Ask four questions.

2
00:00:10,933 --> 00:00:14,056
You are at a fitness centre and want to start working out.

3
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:17,761
Hello. What can I do for you?

4
00:00:22,967 --> 00:00:25,097
Hello, when are you open?

5
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:28,657
We're open from 6 am to 10 pm.

6
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:35,733
How much is a monthly pass?

7
00:00:35,933 --> 00:00:37,765
A month costs 990 crowns.

8
00:00:42,967 --> 00:00:44,300
Do you have a trainer?

9
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,733
Yes, a trainer is here every day.

10
00:00:51,933 --> 00:00:53,000
Is there a shower here?

11
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,797
Yes, the showers are in the changing room.

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Thank you for the information. Goodbye.

13
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,400
We look forward to seeing you.

14
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:09,069
Practise card 13 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
